mlinksva","html_url":"https://github.com/mlinksva","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2020-11-11T05:56:15Z","updated_at":"2020-11-11T05:56:15Z","body":"I don't really remember, but perhaps I didn't submit C-UDA-1.0 at the same time because I wasn't sure whether it qualified for inclusion. I know the inclusion principles were updated earlier this year, though I didn't follow that discussion, so maybe C-UDA-1.0 does qualify now. If so, this submission looks pretty similar to #951 so should be good to go.\r\n\r\nWhich are the current inclusion guidelines? I see https://spdx.dev/license-list/#:~:text=License%20Inclusion%20Principles which looks different from both current(?) and historical versions in https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/d78ad74d106a3ada7aca3cbcbe111a1c48cdb045/DOCS/license-inclusion-principles.md","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/725217627/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/725475237","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1133#issuecomment-725475237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1133","id":725475237,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcyNTQ3NTIzNw==","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-11-11T15:05:59Z","updated_at":"2020-11-11T15:05:59Z","body":"@mlinksva - yeah, so, we are in the midst of updating links, which you discovered! (I just made a PR to do so #1135 )\r\n\r\nThe updated license inclusion principles are here: https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/master/DOCS/license-inclusion-principles.md","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/725475237/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/725599771","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1133#issuecomment-725599771","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1133","id":725599771,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcyNTU5OTc3MQ==","user":{"login":"mlinksva","id":40415,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40415?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva","html_url":"https://github.com/mlinksva","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2020-11-11T18:55:06Z","updated_at":"2020-11-11T18:55:06Z","body":"> If the license does not substantively comply with one of the above open source definitions, then the license is primarily intended for free distribution of content (including, in the case of software, its source code) with limited restrictions, and meets other factors listed here.\r\n\r\nI'm not certain what \"with limited restrictions\" applies to--distribution? C-UDA-1.0's restrictions that go beyond those typically found in open licenses are on use, not distribution, so I guess it qualifies?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/725599771/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/754764691","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1133#issuecomment-754764691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1133","id":754764691,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc1NDc2NDY5MQ==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-01-05T17:01:54Z","updated_at":"2021-01-05T17:01:54Z","body":"Hi @jeanm, thanks for submitting this -- and @mlinksva, thanks for the additional details.\r\n\r\nIn looking at whether or not to add a license to the [SPDX License List](https://spdx.org/licenses), we evaluate them in light of the [SPDX license inclusion principles](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/master/DOCS/license-inclusion-principles.md). Here's my quick run-down of thoughts from holding those up to the C-UDA-1.0:\r\n\r\n**Definitive factors**: The license does appear to meet all of these, with the note that it is not OSI-approved. It is similar to, but substantially different from, [O-UDA-1.0](https://spdx.org/licenses/O-UDA-1.0.html) which is already on the list. Regarding the license steward, I have spoken with members of the legal team at Microsoft (as the original authors of the C-UDA-1.0) and they are aware of and in favor of its submission to the License List.\r\n\r\nI should note also that since the time it was originally submitted, it has now been transitioned to becoming part of the [CDLA family of licenses](https://cdla.dev/computational-use-of-data-agreement-v1-0/) hosted by the Linux Foundation. In light of my own involvement with that effort, I'd especially welcome additional input and +1's or comments from other members of the SPDX legal team on whether to include this license on the list.\r\n\r\n**Other factors**: In addition to the required \"definitive factors\", we look at the totality of the \"other factors\" listed in the inclusion principles:\r\n1. The license likely does not substantially comply with the open source definitions listed here. In particular, looking at the Open Definition from the Open Knowledge Foundation: the license does permit free redistribution and modification of data under C-UDA-1.0, but it restricts \"use\" of the data to \"Computational Use,\" meaning activities necessary to enable the use of Data (alone or along with other material) for analysis by a computer. \r\n  * My understanding is that this is intended in particular for use cases where the underlying data might be subject to other legal restrictions (e.g., data privacy considerations) that make it infeasible to license under an unrestricted-use license; but where Computational Use to generate \"Results\" can be permitted.\r\n  * The license expressly does not impose any restrictions on the use, modification or distribution of \"Results\".\r\n2. It is structured to be used by anyone as a Data Provider.\r\n3. From some searches on GitHub, I am not finding a large number of projects using this license. That said, in addition to use by Microsoft I am also seeing use by groups and organizations not affiliated with Microsoft. Here are a few examples:\r\n  * [Objectron video clips dataset](https://github.com/google-research-datasets/Objectron) from Google\r\n  * [WLASL](https://github.com/dxli94/WLASL/blob/master/index.md) and [MS-ASL](https://github.com/estberg/CSE481N/blob/master/data/MS-ASL/meta/README.md), datasets for sign language recognition\r\n  * A data set for [data type detection](https://github.com/congy/AutoType)\r\n4. The license is primarily intended for free distribution of content, with the restriction to computational use of the data.\r\n5. Microsoft (as the original license steward) and the LF (as the new license steward) are aware of and do not oppose its inclusion on the list.\r\n\r\nBased on the above, although I think that it is a tight balance on the \"other factors,\" I would be in favor of adding C-UDA-1.0 to the SPDX License List. As usual, I'd ask if others involved in the SPDX legal community can add their +1 here or else comment if they have different thoughts.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/754764691/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/774210887","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1133#issuecomment-774210887","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1133","id":774210887,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc3NDIxMDg4Nw==","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-02-05T18:34:27Z","updated_at":"2021-02-05T18:34:27Z","body":"Thanks for the analysis, @swinslow \r\nGiven the totality of the factors, I agree this weighs in favor of adding.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/774210887/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/781500421","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1133#issuecomment-781500421","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1133","id":781500421,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc4MTUwMDQyMQ==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-02-18T17:15:15Z","updated_at":"2021-02-18T17:15:15Z","body":"Discussed on 2021-02-18 legal team call, no objections, agreed to add.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/781500421/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]